    "identifier": "earth-breaker",
    "description": "<p>You slam your weapon into the ground with enough force to upheave the earth. Select a point within your weapons range. All creatures within 10-feet of the chosen point, except for you, must make a Dexterity saving throw taking 4d8 bludgeoning damage and is knocked Prone on a failed save or half damage and no additional effects on a success.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Creatures who fall Prone must spend their full movement to stand up form this jutsu.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Creatures who failed their saving throw reduce their AC by 2, until the beginning of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8.</p>",
